{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_01_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_01",
  "title": "火山制造",
  "storyCode": "OF-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "66c215f2a6de6a42894ad78cfa051a300b132f60ae8f2bfe4a39d9043e785b15",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "原来是这样......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是如此，我们在火山脚下的森林里，碰到了锡兰小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有必要把你们解救我之前的过程描述得这么详细吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得这位大小姐说得对，而且大尾巴你是不是还提到了你觉得我很麻烦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，啊，是你的错觉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不管怎么说，大家平安无事就好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，那么，虽然比较晚了，请容我正式自我介绍一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的名字是锡兰·道尔科斯，维多利亚国立大学毕业，专攻方向是源石研究，也是这座城市市长的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "市长的女儿？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁会想到市长的女儿会独自去未开发的火山林地呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也是因为不得不做一些学者必须要去尝试的冒险......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "继续说回到刚才在火山脚下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你们，陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用客气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，你为什么会一个人来这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只是在沙滩上散步的话，你走得稍微有些远了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，从你身上带的工具来看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普罗旺斯，她也和我们一样，是来查看状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，是这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带着笔记，却穿着洋装和靴子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是单纯的傻子的话，那就只能是————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忽然产生了灵感，忘记换衣服直接冲出家门，等遇到了麻烦才发现穿着问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不记得因为这样的事情烧毁过多少裙子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我觉得这似乎不是应该用理所当然的口吻来描述的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑且不论裙子的事情，大体上你的判断没有错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该说什么好呢，这么做还是有些危险的哦......没有准备完全的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事。只要我在，哪怕是两手空空出门也会很安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，谢谢你们救了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等回到市内时，可以来找我，我会报答你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但抱歉，现在我很忙，我有重要的事要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦原来你还有事，那就不耽误你时间了，不过最好还是不要独自再去火山那里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚才才被这些源石虫袭击了，一个人很危险的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，刚才的事我认为只是个意外。当时我急着上山了，没有注意附近情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在这座城市长大，如果这里的源石虫真的有那么危险，那市长应该早就采取对策了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃，好吧。不过，我觉得，或许它们的聚集是有原因的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里一直都是这样，怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，因为环境改变带来的狂躁化......原来如此，谢谢你，我的证据又多了一条！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......普罗旺斯，看起来她和你发现了一样的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "char_166_skfire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我对火山没有那么熟悉，但是作为一名专业而全面的学者，大致的了解还是有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道说，你们也是来寻找证据的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寻找这座火山可能会爆发的证据？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "火山爆发？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "开玩笑吧？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特殊的刺激性气味，加上异常的气温、狂躁化的源石虫....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
      "speakerId": "char_145_prove",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "况且在火山周围能遇到这种感染生物，也说明这火山也不太一般。要知道如果这山内有源石的话，矿业开采商可是会挤破头的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山的实际情况并没有多少人知道，而且通常也被市政厅和相关机构管理着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为环境改变带来的生物狂躁化......至少对比以前的状况，我多少也能对现在的异变有些猜测。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了保障市民和城市的安全，我一直在到处寻找对此方面有专业经验的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你们务必要帮助我，帮助我让汐斯塔市度过这个难关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
